HISTORY_VERSION 1.0.0

TYPE Foundation

STATUS APPROVED

DATE 2026-07-25

TITLE

PACE consumes its own product: adopted as its own independent, self-governed
root.

WHY

The President directed that PACE must consume its own product — govern itself
with a .pace/ instance validated by its own Kernel — and clarified that PACE
is fully independent: it depends on no consumer. TuPerimetro and any other
adopter are only consumers of PACE. This adoption is roadmap step 4 ("adopt
the first project governed by PACE"); fittingly, the first adopted unit is
PACE itself.

DECISION

Created a .pace/ instance at the PACE repository root, KIND=ORGANIZATION —
the structural root of its own line of authority, since PACE depends on no
parent. (Provisional modeling choice: a dedicated KIND for a standalone
product may be introduced later.) Migrated PACE's own memory into it: mission
and vision (moved out of governance/), a real roadmap and current sprint, the
narrative history entries, and the requests intake (REQUEST-0001..0008). The
engine's source (kernel, services, engines, cli, ontology, contracts,
protocols, standards, policies, the abstract governance protocol, docs) stays
at the repository root as the product itself. Validated with the real engine:
pace doctor and pace context run against this instance.

IMPACT

PACE is now the first project that knows how to explain itself through PACE.
Any AI can run `pace context` on the repository and reconstruct PACE in
seconds — the promise made real on PACE itself.

NEXT_STEPS

Promote the pending requests: the upstream-contribution rule (0006), the
sellable-product structure (0007), and the explainer page (0008). Design
PACE's distributable structure and a public landing page. Build the
Bootstrap/Handoff engine so approved rules load automatically at session
start.

APPROVED_BY

President Cley Duarte

END
